<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#g">Oe&#x017F;terreich</hi>.</head><lb/>
<div n="3" type="jArticle"><dateline><hi rendition="#aq">&#x017F;&#x017F;</hi> <hi rendition="#b">Wien,</hi> 28 Jan.</dateline> <p>Die 16 Gendarmerieregimenter<lb/>
